	skos:definition "A bundle of ATT&CK objects, as MITRE publishes each release of a domain: the domain's collection first, then the objects it holds." ;
	skos:editorialNote "It adds no slot to StixBundle, which stays the schema's tree root; the generated JSON Schema takes AttackBundle as its top class." ;
	skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/lmodel/attack> .
